{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"125508","self":"https://openmrs.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/125508","key":"TRUNK-6701","fields":{"summary":"Avoid redundant per-request session attribute writes in OpenmrsFilter","description":"h2. Background\n\nOn every request, {{OpenmrsFilter}} sets the session's {{username}} attribute to an anonymous placeholder and then immediately overwrites it for authenticated users, re-sets the {{locale}} attribute even when unchanged (marking the session dirty for replicating session managers), and stores a per-request timestamp attribute that nothing in core reads.\n\nh2. Requested change\n\nOnly write session attributes when their values actually change, and remove (or make lazy) the unused unique-id attribute. Session creation behavior is intentionally out of scope and must not change.\n\nh2. Acceptance criteria\n\n* Session attributes end up with the same values as today for anonymous and authenticated requests.\n* No attribute writes occur when values are unchanged.\n* Tests cover both user states.","comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://openmrs.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/125508/comment/196741","id":"196741","author":{"self":"https://openmrs.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3A1d84035b-0f71-466c-a9cf-793c787d8985","accountId":"712020:1d84035b-0f71-466c-a9cf-793c787d8985","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/MM-3.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/MM-3.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/MM-3.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/MM-3.png"},"displayName":"Mujuzi Moses","active":true,"timeZone":"Australia/Sydney","accountType":"atlassian"},"body":"I have a PR for this here: [https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-core/pull/6555|https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-core/pull/6555|smart-link] , please review, your feedback will be appreciated.","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://openmrs.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3A1d84035b-0f71-466c-a9cf-793c787d8985","accountId":"712020:1d84035b-0f71-466c-a9cf-793c787d8985","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/MM-3.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/MM-3.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/MM-3.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/MM-3.png"},"displayName":"Mujuzi Moses","active":true,"timeZone":"Australia/Sydney","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"2026-09-09T09:38:15.725+1000","updated":"2026-09-09T09:38:15.725+1000","jsdPublic":true},{"self":"https://openmrs.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/125508/comment/196802","id":"196802","author":{"self":"https://openmrs.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Acf4d3260-4f00-44a3-a68a-da53d2e5c14a","accountId":"712020:cf4d3260-4f00-44a3-a68a-da53d2e5c14a","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/IB-5.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/IB-5.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/IB-5.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/IB-5.png"},"displayName":"Ian Bacher","active":true,"timeZone":"Australia/Sydney","accountType":"atlassian"},"body":"Merged at https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-core/commit/645814dc2cbf8ac809d61a92949aa308d368db7e\r\n2.9.x backport https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-core/commit/f0dc84a9bf96cb5cd3ef585ef96e287c8eb59807\r\n2.8.x backport https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-core/commit/7d3d2c78b759a5c0bb593bb411116e5681